==Spanish==
{{wp|lang=es}}
[[File:Anabel orla do fila.jpg|thumb|un '''perro''']]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|osp|perro}} (ca. 1200), of {{unc|es|nocap=1}} origin. Originally had a pejorative connotation, but soon began to supplant the Latin word {{m|es|can}}. Perhaps from a call used for dogs; compare {{ncog|gl|apurrar||set the dogs on}}. Another theory derives it from {{der|es|xib|-}}, compare {{cog|ast|perru}}. If so, it may be related to {{cog|es|zorro}}.

